Preserve supervisor continuation ownership

Passive agent mail previously counted as pending root input even though it
could not start a root turn. A due supervisor wake could therefore return
without starting either a helper or a root turn, then clear its durable wake.

Give each supervisor attempt a revocable permit while its helper starts and
runs. Root turns and mail that requests a turn claim continuation through
the same transition boundary. Whichever side claims first owns the next
side effect; the losing helper is retired before it can select an action.

Keep due wakes durable until a successor owns continuation. Passive mail
remains queued while the supervisor proceeds, and failed helper starts
replace due wakes with durable retries.
